WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
Kaze ni kami ga nabiku

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
My hair flows in the wind.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
Kokoro ni hirogaru aozora no deai

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
An encounter in the blue skies of our hearts...

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Tooku hanaretetemo

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Though we are apart,

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
Kanjiru koto wa itsumo kimi dakara

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
I'm always thinking about you,

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
Itsu no hi ka mune wo hatte

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
so let's promise to meet again

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
Au koto wo yakusoku shiyou

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
one day, with our heads held high.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
Zutto futari owari no nai

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
We'll be together, like a dream

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
Yume wo egaku you ni

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
with no end.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
Kimi ni

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
I want

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
Kono omoi itsu no hi ka tsutaetai

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
to tell you this someday.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
Sabishisa wo shiawase ni kaeru tame

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
I'm right here next to you

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
Soba ni iru yo kokoro wa

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
to turn your loneliness into joy.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
Konna ni chikaku ni kanjiru

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
I can feel your heart so close to mine.

00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:36.460
In this world, Maya, there's always someone trying to trip you up.

00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:39.020
Your enemies are all around you.

00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:40.500
You're not allowed to fall in love.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:44.660
Once this show is on the air, you will no longer be a regular member of the public.

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:47.220
You're going to be a star!

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:53.560
Maya, who has just started climbing the stairs to stardom,

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:56.310
has been reprimanded by her manager, Saeko Mizuki,

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:58.750
for falling in love with her co-star,

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:01.330
teen idol, Shigeru Satomi.

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:05.480
Maya is receiving more and more recognition by the day, but...

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:09.800
she's about to fall victim to the dirty dealings of the acting world.

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:16.120
Episode 26 - The Shadows Behind Maya

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:23.610
Who would do something like this?!

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:25.880
It's a good thing you didn't swallow all of it.

00:02:30.770 --> 00:02:34.930
Why would anyone do something this horrible?

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:37.040
You really can't be too careful.

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:40.580
Looks like it was spiked with extra-hot chili sauce somehow.

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:42.730
We should keep our eyes peeled too!

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:44.980
I'm not going to let this get to me!

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:48.720
Wow, this studio is huge!

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:54.030
I'd like to introduce you to Norie Otobe from Kumamoto.

00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:59.100
Please call me Nori.

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:01.680
Hey, you're Maya Kitajima!

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:05.460
This is great!

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:07.570
I mean, you won the Best Supporting Actress Award!

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:09.750
I really hope we can become friends!

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:11.440
Me too.

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:13.880
It's Utako Himekawa!

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:16.630
This is amazing!

00:03:15.430 --> 00:03:16.640
Wait up!

00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:24.660
Heavenly Light

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:30.860
I'm going on soon.

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:34.010
Oh, Miss Satoko! How nice to meet you!

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:36.680
The pleasure is all mine!

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:45.060
There she is!

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:48.760
She's really working hard.

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:50.070
Hang in there, Maya!

00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:51.900
We'll be here watching every week!

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:54.700
You're going to nurse a bowl of food for an hour?!

00:03:56.720 --> 00:04:01.280
Look, it's the woman from the Matsugami Electronics ads.

00:04:06.190 --> 00:04:08.480
Good morning!

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:14.090
Right, we'll do a quick camera run now!

00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:17.300
And five, four, three...

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:24.240
Put Camera Three on Satoko.

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.000
And now, finally...

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:39.390
How wonderful!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:02.090
I've been waiting for you, Mr. Masumi.

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:03.680
Maya's filming right now.

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:08.800
So, do you have any more information on who might want to hurt Maya?

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:11.790
No, whoever it is seems to be laying low for now.

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:16.140
I've come to see you, Maya.

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:18.060
What's going on here?

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:20.720
Looks like they've had a power outage, but I can't get the door open!

00:05:22.790 --> 00:05:24.170
Maya...

00:05:29.990 --> 00:05:33.700
Shigeru, stay back! Don't go up there!

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:35.830
Hey!

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:40.500
Apparently, Maya's hanging from one of the masts!

00:05:42.260 --> 00:05:45.090
Maya, I'm going to fix the mast's balance.

00:05:45.090 --> 00:05:47.570
Hang on tight!

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:58.380
Okay, now crawl over to me.

00:05:58.380 --> 00:06:00.120
Okay!

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:12.350
Just a little further.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:26.360
Thank goodness!

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:40.730
The bolt that holds the mast in place was removed.

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:42.970
It seems someone orchestrated the blackout as well.

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:44.440
Who would do such a thing?

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:46.600
Who are you?!

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:50.780
I was told to bring you some tea.

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:53.810
Oh, it's you. Were you eavesdropping on our conversation?

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:56.950
No, I didn't hear a thing!

00:06:58.190 --> 00:07:01.560
What? It was sabotage?

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:04.650
I thought you should know.

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:12.280
So there's a huge storm raging outside.

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:15.760
Satoko has come to deliver an important letter to the British Ambassador.

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:19.990
Before she enters the room to meet him, she gathers her composure,

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:22.920
and stands in front of the door with pride and poise.

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:23.860
Got it?

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:24.770
Yes, sir.

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:33.540
Here we go. Very good.

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:36.610
Miss Satoko, the ambassador is waiting for you.

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:45.880
Sir,

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:49.370
Miss Satoko Tanuma has come to see you.

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:22.040
Cut!

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:25.660
No matter how composed she might be, I can't film Satoko when she's soaking wet!

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:26.800
Wait.

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:30.790
Please wait. I'm going to do it.

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:35.430
Please let me do it the way I am now.

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:37.670
What are you talking about?

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:40.760
I won't deviate from the image of her in the script.

00:08:40.760 --> 00:08:43.350
Deviate from her image?

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:47.150
You want to play the daughter of a nobleman in that state?

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:50.360
But if you think you can do it, go ahead.

00:08:50.360 --> 00:08:52.220
Thank you.

00:08:52.220 --> 00:08:53.930
We're running out of time!

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:55.330
We're going to have to record this.

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:56.740
Get the cameras ready!

00:08:58.150 --> 00:09:03.350
I have one objective and that is to give this letter to the ambassador.

00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:05.980
There's a storm raging outside.

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:11.800
Satoko Tanuma is here to see you.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:21.560
She looks like she just ran in!

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:27.080
I see...

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:31.690
It actually looks like she's run through the rain to bring him the letter!

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:34.440
It's an honor to meet you.

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:38.450
I am Torajiro Tanuma's daughter, Satoko.

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:42.480
She really stands out.

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:45.570
Way more than she did before.

00:09:45.570 --> 00:09:47.300
Miss Satoko,

00:09:47.300 --> 00:09:51.450
the ambassador would like to personally express his gratitude for bringing him this letter.

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:55.930
Thank you.

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:08.670
Okay, cut!

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:14.030
That's a wrap for this scene. Good job, Maya!

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:15.980
Thank you!

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:18.500
Hooray!

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:21.220
She'll be a star in no time!

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:25.520
I can't believe it.

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:43.260
The next shot is a scene where Satoko, who has just found out...

00:10:43.260 --> 00:10:46.660
that the recently-deceased Fuku was actually her sister, picks up...

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:50.020
her sister's favorite beanbags and watches her coffin being carried away while singing a lullaby.

00:10:56.470 --> 00:10:59.020
Good night, Mari!

00:11:01.610 --> 00:11:03.620
She's still practicing?

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:11.060
I'm really sorry about the movie!

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:13.680
I didn't know you'd already been cast.

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:17.760
I may not be able to perform the role as well as you would have,

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:19.720
but I'm going to try my best!

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:22.700
I love acting!

00:11:26.980 --> 00:11:29.110
Tomoe...

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:38.080
Heavenly Light

00:11:43.980 --> 00:11:47.100
Why have you called me here?

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:51.040
I really want you to watch today's broadcast.

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:54.560
Fuku really loved these beanbags.

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:11.560
One and two flow into three and four...

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:23.040
Someone's taken the threads out of the beanbag!

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:25.130
All of the other bags have been destroyed as well!

00:12:25.130 --> 00:12:26.070
What?!

00:12:29.650 --> 00:12:31.400
Don't tell me you guys did this?!

00:12:31.400 --> 00:12:34.230
Sir, look at her.

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:38.980
Just keep the camera on Satoko.

00:12:39.620 --> 00:12:41.040
Thank you.

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:52.050
One and two flow into three and four...

00:12:52.050 --> 00:12:57.840
Five and six flow into seven and eight...

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:03.430
Tonight, the thirteenth night, I am alone with my beanbags.

00:13:03.430 --> 00:13:09.100
Father, Mother: when will you return?

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:12.000
One and two flow into three and four...

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:14.500
Five and six flow into seven and eight...

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:20.400
Tonight, the thirteenth night, I am alone with my beanbags.

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:30.930
Father, Mother: when will you return?

00:13:21.930 --> 00:13:23.900
This girl's unbelievable.

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:25.930
That was good.

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:36.270
That was despicable, pulling the strings out of the beanbags!

00:13:36.270 --> 00:13:41.950
I was angry that she took my movie role from me, but I can accept it if it's her.

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:46.930
I want her to have a shot at acting, fair and square.

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:48.510
We're really sorry!

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:49.140
What?

00:13:49.480 --> 00:13:51.390
These were the girls...

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:54.300
who sent you hate mail and wrecked the beanbags.

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:56.140
I'm really sorry.

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:58.230
Oh, you don't have to apologize.

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:00.910
I'm looking forward to seeing you in your summer movie.

00:14:00.910 --> 00:14:01.510
What?

00:14:02.640 --> 00:14:03.940
Break a leg.

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:06.230
Gotcha!

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:11.190
Thank you, Tomoe.

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:13.350
She's not a bad person, after all.

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:17.780
But then who was responsible for the bucket of water and the mast sabotage?

00:14:17.780 --> 00:14:18.790
Maya!

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.750
Look, it's Ayumi's show!

00:14:23.820 --> 00:14:26.640
She plays the protagonist who falls in love with a man, but then finds out...

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:29.190
that he's already involved with someone else.

00:14:29.670 --> 00:14:31.180
She still wants to tell him how she feels about him, though.

00:14:31.610 --> 00:14:34.130
It's not an easy role.

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:39.730
I... I...

00:14:48.790 --> 00:14:52.320
How is she able to wear an expression like that?

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:55.870
I guess the rumors that she's fallen in love must be true.

00:14:56.430 --> 00:14:57.640
What rumors?

00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:02.070
Hey, that's Ayumi Himekawa!

00:15:02.070 --> 00:15:04.630
She's with that kid, Susumu Hazama.

00:15:05.030 --> 00:15:08.710
Looks like we've become the newest piece of gossip, doesn't it?

00:15:08.710 --> 00:15:09.870
What do you mean by "we"?

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:11.980
You know, me and you.

00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:13.800
I mean, everyone's looking at us.

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:19.710
Where are you going, Ayumi?

00:15:20.240 --> 00:15:24.670
I have an appointment at the theater, so I'd better get moving.

00:15:25.380 --> 00:15:27.100
Plus,

00:15:27.430 --> 00:15:30.700
I don't really like the word "we".

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:32.620
I don't want to be lumped together with anyone.

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:35.440
Ayumi!

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:39.770
Ayumi!

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:46.440
Thank you, Miss Ayumi.

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:49.880
I have to say, it'll be a real pleasure to play someone who has such a beautiful girl falling in love with him.

00:15:50.270 --> 00:15:55.880
And I will consider this a lesson on how to fall in love with an older man.

00:15:56.700 --> 00:16:01.610
This role sees eighteen-year-old Anja falling in love with her own uncle.

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:04.080
An Enigma's Blackout
The Discovery of a Relationship

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:06.820
So, I guess this is it, Maya.

00:16:06.820 --> 00:16:07.460
What?

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:11.400
I can't continue meeting up with you as a friend anymore.

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:12.680
Sakurakouji!

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:15.490
I'm going to keep working on my acting...

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:19.440
and the next time we meet, I hope I can actually pose a threat to you.

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:22.780
Take care.

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:28.400
But...

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:35.770
Goodbye, Maya.

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:41.080
I'm sorry!

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:44.510
I'm sorry!

00:16:46.890 --> 00:16:52.760
<i>Heavenly Light</i> received rave reviews and Satoko's popularity has skyrocketed.

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:54.040
Today's Guest

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:55.450
By this point, there's not a single person in Japan...

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:58.400
who doesn't know the name Maya Kitajima.

00:16:58.400 --> 00:16:59.840
However...

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:04.790
We still can't find her!!
The Mother!

00:17:07.490 --> 00:17:08.750
Mom.

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:18.060
Next, she started shooting the movie <i>White Jungle</i> as the lead character.

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:29.120
Mom, acting is so wonderful.

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:34.770
Are you watching me somewhere, Mom?

00:17:34.770 --> 00:17:36.550
Maya!

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:39.030
Norie!

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:41.260
I wanted to watch you filming!

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:45.510
Movie shoots are so cool!

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:53.010
<i>The White Jungle</i>
Wrap Party

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:59.200
I'm going to have to show both Daito Entertainment and that little girl...

00:17:59.200 --> 00:18:01.840
that I'm no pushover!

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:03.050
Miss Yamazaki!

00:18:03.050 --> 00:18:06.920
Could you give us a few words about your impressions of Maya Kitajima and her newest movie?

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:09.090
I have to say, I'm surprised.

00:18:09.090 --> 00:18:12.200
It seems they'll put anyone in a movie these days.

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:13.710
Mind if I join you?

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:17.560
You want <i>me</i> in a commercial for Muse Cosmetics?!

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:22.320
It'll be an international venture. The commercials will be shot with numerous World Heritage sites...

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:24.310
as a backdrop to your enchanting smile.

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:27.570
Something as minor as Matsugami Electronics ads can be left...

00:18:27.570 --> 00:18:30.130
to someone else.

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:35.860
An actress as famous as yourself should feature in international commercials.

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:39.560
Daito Entertainment also has a blockbuster movie lined up for you.

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:42.560
Foreign locations? A blockbuster movie?

00:18:42.560 --> 00:18:45.990
I guess I should bury the hatchet with Daito for the time being

00:18:45.990 --> 00:18:50.170
I was wondering if you could elaborate a little on your previous statement.

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:53.200
You were asking about Maya Kitajima, right?

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:55.230
Well, I think she's just fabulous!

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:57.470
She has such a promising future!

00:18:59.270 --> 00:19:01.230
It's Shigeru Satomi!

00:19:04.770 --> 00:19:07.890
I came to see you, Adventure Girl!

00:19:07.890 --> 00:19:10.420
Mr. Satomi, did you come here today...

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:12.540
because of your feelings for Miss Maya?

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:13.730
I have, yes.

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:15.890
What a scoop!

00:19:16.660 --> 00:19:17.960
And how about you, Miss Maya?

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:19.440
Are you going to answer his confession of love?

00:19:19.440 --> 00:19:21.190
I would like to add something at this point!

00:19:21.190 --> 00:19:22.460
Wait.

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:31.290
Yes, I'm in love with him.

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:36.450
I'm very happy to hear that.

00:19:36.760 --> 00:19:41.420
Miss Mizuki, may I take Maya out the next time she has some time off?

00:19:41.420 --> 00:19:42.960
Um, of course.

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:49.240
So, you got your way after all, didn't you, Shigeru Satomi?

00:19:49.240 --> 00:19:51.920
You knew our two corporations would stand in the way,

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:54.070
which is why you chose a public place to make your confession.

00:19:54.070 --> 00:19:56.610
But I'll find a way to break up this relationship.

00:19:57.990 --> 00:19:59.330
That girl...

00:20:02.820 --> 00:20:05.860
Maya Kitajima has gone too far this time!

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:10.960
When I'm with you, it feels like I can be true to myself.

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:13.420
I don't have to be Shigeru Satomi, Teen Idol.

00:20:14.340 --> 00:20:18.340
A carefree, honest relationship is what I'm looking for, Maya.

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:25.450
I don't think I've ever felt so relaxed before.

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:28.830
<i>Heavenly Light</i>

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:31.000
I've really become a fan of yours, Maya.

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:33.400
Will you let me be your personal assistant?

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:34.600
Sure.

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:36.670
You've made me so happy!

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:39.180
