00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:00.860
Yes?

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:02.520
Mr. Masumi?

00:21:02.520 --> 00:21:04.930
What? A beauty contest upstager?!

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:08.270
Norie Otobe's real name is Suzuko Tashiro.

00:21:08.270 --> 00:21:11.310
