Feel the love!

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:25.880
Mom, I've fallen in love.

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:31.890
He's a wonderful person and I'm in high school, after all.

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:35.980
I've gained a new fan after he saw me acting...

00:23:35.980 --> 00:23:37.840
and he's now paying my tuition fees.

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:42.470
Mom, I know I was never any good at anything, but I'm really trying hard...

00:23:42.470 --> 00:23:44.960
